design\feature_descriptions\B_016_config_init_during_render.md:14:`ensureConfigServiceInitialized()` is called in the render body of `ProjectWorkspace` and `ConfigPage`. That is a side effect during render, against the documented two-phase service lifecycle ("Config-dependent work runs in init()/start()/app bootstrap"), and fragile under React StrictMode double-rendering and future concurrent rendering.
design\feature_descriptions\B_016_config_init_during_render.md:17:- Initialize `configService` exactly once in app bootstrap: `useAppBootstrap` already calls `configService.init(...)` — make that unconditional and early (before any component that might read config renders), including the no-last-project path.
