design\feature_descriptions\B_036_config_values_not_typed_per_key.md:30:- Type `configService.get<K extends ConfigKey>(key: K): ConfigValueTypes[K]` and `set(key, value: ConfigValueTypes[K])`; `useConfigValue`/`useConfigValueOrFallback` already generic — they start returning the narrow type for free.
design\feature_descriptions\B_036_config_values_not_typed_per_key.md:31:- Remove the now-redundant `as string` / `as AgentProfile[]` casts at consumers (`app_menu.tsx`, `action_popup_content.tsx`, `config_value_editor.tsx`, `github_auth_service`, commit batcher delay, …).
design\feature_descriptions\B_036_config_values_not_typed_per_key.md:32:- Keep `ConfigValue` as the union only where genuinely heterogeneous handling is needed (the generic config-page editor, validation dispatch).
